import staff_prompts
STYLE='''PIXEL-ART fighting-game animation atlas. Preserve the exact supplied Sproto identity, face/eye count, colors, clothing and proportions. ONE complete actor per cell; TWO coherent arms and TWO low-rooted legs. He always holds a BLACK HANDHELD MICROPHONE with a rounded SILVER mesh grille, securely gripped in one hand. This is a normal short microphone, not a long staff or sword. Attacks hit with the MICROPHONE: forward mic jabs, overhead mic swings, low mic sweeps and airborne mic strikes. Legs support or tuck, never substitute for the weapon. Vocal casts hold the microphone near the mouth. Entire microphone/body fit with generous margins. Solid magenta #ff00ff background, crisp stepped pixel edges, dark outlines and compact shading. No detached props, labels, text, grid lines or floating effects.'''
CORE=staff_prompts.CORE.replace('STAFF','MICROPHONE').replace('staff','microphone')
